    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This property is an attractive 2-bedroom 1st floor apartment residence. It has an attractive & contemporary layout & is situated in a desirable location. \n\nSCHEDULE OF ACCOMMODATION\n\nENTRANCE HALL: 3.60m x 1.40m + 0.90m x 1.70m \nTimber over concrete floor. Painted plastered walls and ceiling. Ceiling coving. Built-in closet. \n\nKITCHEN:1.70m x 3.60m\nCeramic tile over concrete floor. Shaker-style kitchen. Ceramic tile splashback over worktop. Venetian blind. Painted ceiling with ceiling coving. \n\nSITTING ROOM: 5.25m x 5.10m \nTimber over concrete floor. Painted plastered walls and ceiling. Ceiling coving. Door to balcony.\n\nMASTER BEDROOM:2.60m x 5.15m \nTimber over concrete floor. Painted plastered walls and ceiling. Ceiling coving. Built-in wardrobes. Wall-hung convector heater.\n\nENSUITE: 2.70m x 1.90m\nCeramic tile floor to ceiling. Painted plastered ceiling. Ceiling coving. Shower cubicle with shower tray. Wash hand basin with pedestal. Wall-hung mirror. Pan. Wall-hung towel radiator.\n\nBEDROOM 2:3.90m x 2.00m \nTimber over concrete floor. Painted plastered walls and ceiling. Ceiling coving. Built-in wardrobe.\n\nBATHROOM:2.50m x 1.85m\nCeramic tile floor to ceiling. Painted plastered ceiling. Ceiling coving. Bath with mixer tap and stand-in shower. Shower screen. Wall-hung mirror over Wash hand basin with pedestal. Pan. Wall-hung towel radiator.\n\nThe overall accommodation area measures approximately 70 square metres (753.2 sq. ft.).\n\nSERVICES\nMains water, mains drainage, main electricity. \n"
      },
